{"3733650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horror Night with Tung Tung Tung Sahur", "steam_appid": 3733650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Night with TUNG TUNG TUNG SAHUR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car broke down. Middle of the forest. <strong>No signal</strong>. You spot a creepy mansion up the hill. You knock. No answer. Just as you turn to leave—CREAK—the door opens by itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- You step in.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Bad idea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Now you’re trapped.</i></strong> No windows open. No doors unlock. But something is inside. And it’s not happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the shadows, you hear it:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- “TUNG. TUNG. TUNG. SAHUR.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He’s coming</strong>. He’s got games. And you’re the main player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Tung Tung Tung Sahur, a drum-beating nightmare with a twisted sense of fun. He doesn't want to kill you right away—he wants to play. If you want to survive, you’ll need to solve every cursed puzzle, dodge every jumpscare, and outsmart his chaotic friends, including the one and only Tralalero Tralala, who might be your only hope… if he stops spinning in circles for five seconds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore a Haunted Mansion full of traps, cursed hallways, and basements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve Deadly Puzzles before the next round of TUNG TUNG begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Snap Creepy Photos to reveal secrets (and maybe unlock a screaming ghost or two).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use a Pistol to slow Tung Tung down when he gets too close for comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive Brainrot Mayhem featuring a cast of cursed icons like Ballerina Cappuccina, Tralalero Tralala, and the caffeinated specter known as Assassino Cappuccino</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s only one rule in this mansion: Play the game, or the game plays you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>TUNG.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>TUNG.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>TUNG. SAHUR.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You knocked. Now you’re stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Night with TUNG TUNG TUNG SAHUR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car broke down. Middle of the forest. <strong>No signal</strong>. You spot a creepy mansion up the hill. You knock. No answer. Just as you turn to leave—CREAK—the door opens by itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- You step in.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Bad idea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Now you’re trapped.</i></strong> No windows open. No doors unlock. But something is inside. And it’s not happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the shadows, you hear it:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- “TUNG. TUNG. TUNG. SAHUR.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He’s coming</strong>. He’s got games. And you’re the main player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Tung Tung Tung Sahur, a drum-beating nightmare with a twisted sense of fun. He doesn't want to kill you right away—he wants to play. If you want to survive, you’ll need to solve every cursed puzzle, dodge every jumpscare, and outsmart his chaotic friends, including the one and only Tralalero Tralala, who might be your only hope… if he stops spinning in circles for five seconds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore a Haunted Mansion full of traps, cursed hallways, and basements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve Deadly Puzzles before the next round of TUNG TUNG begins.</